    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "つよい　のろいを　こめて　かかれた こだいの　えが　デスマスの たましいを　とりこみ　うごきだした。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les motifs antiques qui ont été gravés en y incorporant une puissante malédiction ont aspiré l’âme de Tutafeh avant de prendre vie.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "A powerful curse was woven into an ancient painting. After absorbing the spirit of a Yamask, the painting began to move.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "強い　呪いを　こめて　描かれた 古代の　絵が　デスマスの 魂を　取り込み　動きだした。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "かげの　ような　からだに　ふれては いけない。　えに　きざまれた おそろしい　きおくを　みせられるぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Quiconque touchera son corps semblable à une ombre devra endurer la vision des souvenirs effroyables gravés dans ses motifs.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Never touch its shadowlike body, or you’ll be shown the horrific memories behind the picture carved into it.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "影の　ような　体に　触れては いけない。　絵に　刻まれた 恐ろしい　記憶を　見せられるぞ。",
        "language": {
